			<Char_Desc_450>PC photo album maker software, map browsing, face classification, photo editing.
Local storage, quick import, no need to upload to the web, simple and secure.
Includes features such as Calendar Browsing, Map Browsing, Face Sorting, Slide Show, and Photo Quality Rating.
Built-in inpaint, cutout and other functions.
PhotoNest excels when it comes to sorting tens or even hundreds of thousands of photos.
Support for encrypted storage.</Char_Desc_450>
			<Char_Desc_2000>PC photo album maker software, map browsing, face classification, photo editing.
Local storage, quick import, no need to upload to the web, simple and secure. One of the encrypted versions, only those who know the correct password can unlock and access the photos in the album.
Includes features such as Calendar Browsing, Map Browsing, Face Sorting, Slide Show, and Photo Quality Rating.
Built-in inpaint, cutout and other functions, no need for professional skills, save time and effort.
PhotoNest excels when it comes to sorting tens or even hundreds of thousands of photos.
Support for encrypted storage.
</Char_Desc_2000>
